    802B  48        PHA
    802C  8A        TXA                     ; never copies the ROM across the Tube or enters it at BREAK; the terminal then runs
    802D  48        PHA
    802E  A5 84     LDA &84                 ; as an OS command instead (see the guide: "does not start up as a language")
