;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Check the adaptor (adaptor_status). If it is off or missing, switch the ROM off for
; this session: no workspace (the &0DF0 byte is cleared) and no language flag, so
; PAGE is not raised. Otherwise initialise the private workspace.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.init_or_disable
