; DOWNLOAD A TELESOFTWARE FILE
; Data is decoded from the Redefinable Telesoftware Format (RTF) a block (one sub-page)
; at a time. With discs or networks each block is written to the file as it completes
; (OPENOUT + OSGBPB); on tape the whole file is kept in memory from OSHWM and saved at
; the end. The block map at &7100 records which blocks have arrived (disordered files).
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.download
